# Dan Brubaker Horst

> Personal website of Dan Brubaker Horst — Principal Engineer, technical writer, and hobbyist rocketeer based in South Bend, IN.

Dan writes about software engineering, enterprise architecture, DevOps, product design, and personal interests. He has been building software professionally since 2007. Everything on this site is written in his own voice; he does not use AI to generate prose.

## Core

- [About](<%= publication_url('/about/') %>): Background, current role, and interests
- [Work With Me](<%= publication_url('/work-with-me/') %>): Professional background, skills inventory, and availability for staff engineer or engineering lead roles
- [Writing](<%= publication_url('/writing/') %>): Long-form technical and personal essays
- [AI](<%= publication_url('/ai/') %>): How Dan uses AI on this site and his personal ethics statement

